1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,270
Listen to a talk in a business class.

2
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:11,220
Let's discuss the role of startup incubators in supporting new businesses.

3
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:17,433
These are programs designed to help startups navigate the early stages of development

4
00:00:17,433 --> 00:00:25,150
and increase their chances of success by providing resources, mentorship, and networking.

5
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:29,060
What resources might a new business lack?

6
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:35,096
Incubators often provide office space and equipment to help startups get off the ground,

7
00:00:35,096 --> 00:00:40,110
and they also steer new businesses toward funding opportunities.

8
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:47,631
Many new entrepreneurs lack the financial means to invest in basic necessities themselves,

9
00:00:47,631 --> 00:00:51,020
and this support can be invaluable.

10
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:55,030
Another important element of incubators is mentorship.

11
00:00:55,030 --> 00:01:02,240
Experienced professionals and industry experts offer guidance and advice to startup founders.

12
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:05,292
Starting a business is full of pitfalls,

13
00:01:05,292 --> 00:01:08,827
and a good mentor can help you avoid some of the more common ones,

14
00:01:08,827 --> 00:01:12,160
not to mention refine your business strategies.

15
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:17,160
Networking opportunities are another significant benefit of incubators.

16
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:23,120
What does a new enterprise need more than anything else? Investors.

17
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:31,137
Being part of an incubator program allows you to connect with potential investors, other

18
00:01:31,137 --> 00:01:31,709
entrepreneurs,

19
00:01:31,709 --> 00:01:34,000
and future business partners.

20
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,090
Now, participating in an incubator is not without its challenges.

21
00:01:38,090 --> 00:01:42,157
There's a lot of competition to get into some of these programs,

22
00:01:42,157 --> 00:01:44,190
so not all startups are accepted.

23
00:01:44,190 --> 00:01:49,806
Once you've been accepted, the pressure to perform and meet milestones can be intense,

24
00:01:49,806 --> 00:01:55,020
and failure to do so can lose you the support of the incubator.

25
00:01:55,020 --> 00:02:00,010
That said, the benefits can be substantial.

26
00:02:00,010 --> 00:02:11,020
Incubators provide a supportive environment that fosters innovation and helps startups overcome the hurdles of early-stage development.
